nces\"><a href=\"#val-checkpoint_differences\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> checkpoint_differences : <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-checkpoint\">checkpoint</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The components of the session that differ from the checkpoint (physically; padding arrays by contents), by name.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-checkpoint_sizes\"><a href=\"#val-checkpoint_sizes\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> checkpoint_sizes : <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-checkpoint\">checkpoint</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The open frontier's sizes at the checkpoint.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-forward_conflicts_by_cells\"><a href=\"#val-forward_conflicts_by_cells\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> forward_conflicts_by_cells : <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The roots <a href=\"../index.html#val-consume_forward_code\"><code>consume_forward_code</code></a> would refuse <code>t</code> over, by name, as its owner cells say (gh-ocannl-1796).</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-forward_conflicts_by_live_roots\"><a href=\"#val-forward_conflicts_by_live_roots\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> forward_conflicts_by_live_roots : <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The same, by the pre-gh-ocannl-1796 rule over the live forward roots: equal to <a href=\"#val-forward_conflicts_by_cells\"><code>forward_conflicts_by_cells</code></a> while every root is held.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-owner_count\"><a href=\"#val-owner_count\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> owner_count : <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The number of owners <code>t</code>'s forward owner cell records, as last compacted (the probe compacts nothing itself).</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-drop_owner_edges\"><a href=\"#val-drop_owner_edges\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> drop_owner_edges : <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Forgets every owner of <code>t</code>'s forward owner cell: a negative control of the <code>debug_check_forward_root_owners</code> check, standing for a source of <code>embedded_nodes</code> that added no owner edge.</p></div></div>"}